msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「（......I had a dream.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Tuve un sueño.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（It was a hellish nightmare, filled with all＿of the misery I had wished to avoid.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Fue una pesadilla infernal, llena de＿toda la miseria que deseaba evitar.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......And yet, in a way, it was sweet.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Y aun así fue algo dulce.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（..................）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（..................）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I seem to recall having had this dream＿before......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Me parece recordar haber tenido＿este sueño antes......）」"

msgid "???「......ji.」"
msgstr "???「......ji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Puppies......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Perritos......）」"

msgid "???「Ryuu......」"
msgstr "???「Ryuu......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（So many puppies......!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿Tantos perritos......?!）」"

msgid "???「WAKE UP, YOU MONGREL!!」"
msgstr "???「¡¡DESPIERTA, PERRO!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ugggh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ugggh!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Owwww. Damn you! You're worse than＿an alarm clock......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ayyyy. ¡Maldición! Eres peor＿que un despertador......」"

msgid "Taiga「Food.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Comida.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「FOOOOOD! Make it quick!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡COMIIIIDA! ¡Hazla rápido!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Yawn*...... What time is it......? Wait, it's＿only 5:30! ......Back to bed.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「*Bostezo*...... ¿Qué hora......? ¡Solo＿las 5:30! ......Me vuelvo a dormir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ugggh!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡Ugggh!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What is your problem!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué te pasa?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't dawdle. Listen. I can't be＿compared to a Snorlax like you. I have＿things to do. Got it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「No remolonees. Escucha. No puedes＿compararme con un Snorlax como tú. Tengo＿cosas que hacer. ¿Entendido?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If you're hungry, just eat whatever's in＿the fridge. Kelp rolls, chicken stir fry,＿black beans......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si tienes hambre, come lo que haya en＿el refrigerador. Rollos de alga, pollo＿salteado, frijoles negros......」"

msgid "Taiga「That's the same stuff from yesterday.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso es lo mismo de ayer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I know. And there's plenty of it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, lo sé. Y todavía queda bastante.」"

msgid "Taiga「No way, it's old now. Hey, there's still＿mochi left over from New Year's,＿right? I wanna eat red bean soup.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ni hablar, ya está viejo. Oye, todavía＿queda mochi de Año Nuevo, ¿verdad?＿Quiero comer sopa de frijol rojo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Denied.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Denegado.」"

msgid "Taiga「I want something sweet! Red bean＿soup, red bean soup, RED BEAN＿SOUP!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Quiero algo dulce! Sopa de frijol＿rojo, sopa de frijol rojo, ¡¡SOPA＿DE FRIJOL ROJO!!」"

msgid "Taiga「......You've been taking it easy for quite＿some time now.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Llevas bastante tiempo＿tomándotelo con calma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Taiga「I was sure with your essential＿memories wiped you wouldn't give your＿master much trouble, but au contraire.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estaba segura de que sin tus recuerdos＿esenciales no le darías problemas a tu＿ama, pero todo lo contrario.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Taiga「You have the time to remember＿pointless trivia, but you don't have the＿time to make ME breakfast, is that it!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tienes tiempo para recordar datos＿inútiles, pero no para prepararme＿a MÍ el desayuno, ¡¿es eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「ARGH! For crying out loud! I get it, I get＿it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡ARGH! ¡Por el amor de Dios!＿¡Ya entendí, ya entendí!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Aquí tienes.」"

msgid "Taiga「Mmm, smells good～」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mmm, huele bien～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's hot, so don't burn your tongue.＿Blow on it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está caliente, así que no te＿quemes la lengua. Sóplale.」"

msgid "Taiga「I KNOW. Shut it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「YA LO SÉ. Cállate.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Where are your manners?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Dónde están tus modales?」"

msgid "Taiga「Thanks for the food!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Gracias por la comida!」"

msgid "Taiga「Yum......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Qué rico......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Of course it is. The key is the secret＿ingredient - a pinch of salt.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pues claro que sí. La clave es el＿ingrediente secreto: una pizca de sal.」"

msgid "Taiga「You remember that stuff pretty well. I＿wish you'd made it when I asked you＿the first time.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Recuerdas bastante bien esas cosas.＿Ojalá lo hubieras hecho cuando te＿lo pedí la primera vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Excuse me, Princess...... No, first of all,＿what's with you getting up on your own＿at this hour? Any special reason?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Disculpe, Princesa...... No, antes que＿nada, ¿a qué viene levantarse sola a＿esta hora? ¿Alguna razón especial?」"

msgid "Taiga「N-None of your...... HOT!」"
msgstr "Taiga「N-No es tu...... ¡QUEMA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sheesh, I warned you! Have some＿water!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Cielos, te lo advertí!＿¡Toma un poco de agua!」"

msgid "Taiga「......I hab sobehin to hoo.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tedgo adgo bue hazer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Something you have to do? Do what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Algo que hacer? ¿Hacer qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nuh, nub ub yoh bibniz.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Do, do eb du asundo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm sure it IS my business. You kicked＿me awake first thing in the morning＿and had me make you breakfast.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro que SÍ es mi asunto. Me＿despertaste a patadas a primera hora＿y me hiciste prepararte el desayuno.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shuh ub.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Gállade.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Maybe I'll go with you. I might＿remember something, after all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tal vez vaya contigo. Puede que＿recuerde algo, después de todo.」"

msgid "Taiga「*Gasp*! N-No, you can't!! You just can't!!＿You stalker!! ......Owwwww!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ah! ¡¡N-No, no puedes!! ¡¡No puedes!!＿¡¡Acosador!! ......¡Ayyyyy!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Have some water.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Toma un poco de agua.」"

msgid "Taiga「Doh cub wid be.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Do bedgas codbigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, okay, I won't go with you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, bien, no iré contigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, where are your manners?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, ¿dónde están tus modales?」"

msgid "Taiga「Thanks for the food!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Gracias por la comida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What is she hiding......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué estará ocultando......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Now that I ate breakfast, I don't feel＿like going back to bed......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ahora que ya desayuné, no tengo ganas＿de volver a la cama......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......And the TV shows won't be all that＿different from what was on yesterday.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Y los programas de tele no serán＿muy distintos a los de ayer.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Guess I'll go out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Supongo que saldré.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Here's the deal. Traditional New Year's＿food lasts a long time so that＿househusbands can take a breather.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Escucha. La comida tradicional de Año＿Nuevo dura mucho tiempo para que los＿amos de casa puedan tomar un respiro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A three-day breather at that. If you＿can understand that, then do as you＿like. I'm going back to sleep.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Un respiro de tres días, además.＿Si lo entiendes, haz lo que quieras.＿Me vuelvo a dormir.」"
